  "instructions": [
    "Prick the eggplants all over so steam can escape during grilling.",
    "Grill the eggplants, turning frequently, until the skins blacken and the flesh is soft.",
    "Cool the eggplants in water, peel away the skins, and arrange the flesh in a shallow dish.",
    "Stir the coconut milk with lemon, chili, and salt until evenly seasoned.",
    "Pour the dressing over the eggplant, add the green onions, and fold everything together gently."
